    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Sarah,<br><br>blavaan cannot currently do this, but it is on the to-do list. Right now, your best bet is to export the JAGS or Stan code, then edit the code to handle ordinal data. But this admittedly requires some expertise.<br><br></div><div>Best,<br></div><div>Ed<br><br></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Mon, Mar 19, 2018 at 8:55 AM, Sarah Alsaadi <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">sarah....@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Thanks in advance!<div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div><br></div><div>Sarah</div></div><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;blavaan&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">blavaan+unsubscribe@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/blavaan/6fdf8831-443f-4ed2-9ff7-fbdbb007c274%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/blavaan/6fdf8831-443f-4ed2-9ff7-fbdbb007c274%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792463545223000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1ZBylTVj976F0xxHqpqzRj\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/blavaan/6fdf8831-443f-4ed2-9ff7-fbdbb007c274%40googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792463545223000&amp;usg=AOvVaw35gB7lPvwCSxF1Moh3sqNI\">https: