     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Right now, your best bet is to export the JAGS or Stan code, then edit the code to handle ordinal data. But this admittedly requires some expertise.<br></div></div></blockquote><div><br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>For guidance, you can find a description in chapter 5 this textbook, along with some example BUGS syntax (which is the same as JAGS syntax).</div><div><br></div><div>Song &amp; Lee (2012) <a href=\"https://books.google.nl/books/about/Basic_and_Advanced_Bayesian_Structural_E.html?id=AMSR_jp-pD0C&amp;printsec=frontcover&amp;source=kp_read_button&amp;redir_esc=y#v=onepage&amp;q&amp;f=false\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://books.google.nl/books/about/Basic_and_Advanced_Bayesian_Structural_E.html?id%3DAMSR_jp-pD0C%26printsec%3Dfrontcover%26source%3Dkp_read_button%26redir_esc%3Dy%23v%3Donepage%26q%26f%3Dfalse&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792463545223000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3OOQkNt7EJB_R1ehFDIeID\">Basic and Advanced Bayesian Structural Equation Modeling</a><br></div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">Terrence D. Jorgensen</div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">Postdoctoral Researcher, Methods and Statistics</div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">Research Institute for Child Development and Education, the University of Amsterdam</div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">UvA web page: <a href=\"http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792463545223000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0ZkW9R5B31dj5KO6CmmYTH\">http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen</a></div><div><br></div></div></div></div>"
