     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Sarah<div><br></div><div>I had worked an example for the Graded Response Model (GRM) using JAGS. GRM is an IRT model for ordered categorical variables.</div><div><br></div><div>In this link I show my solution with JAGS for multidimensional GRM, as Ed said you could work from these code or blavaan exported code to adjust it for your case</div><div><pre style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap!important;font-size:10pt!important\"><span style=\"color:blue\"><a href=\"https://sourceforge.net/p/mcmc-jags/discussion/610036/thread/87f19cd7/\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://sourceforge.net/p/mcmc-jags/discussion/610036/thread/87f19cd7/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792463545225000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1i3uAnNsdtCGXtte8ww87E\">https://sourceforge.net/p/mcmc-jags/discussion/610036/thread/87f19cd7/</a></span></pre><pre style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap!important;font-size:10pt!important\"><span style=\"color:blue\"><br></span></pre><pre style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap!important;font-size:10pt!important\"><span style=\"color:blue\"><br></span></pre><pre style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap!important;font-size:10pt!important\"><span style=